=head2 SDL_hid_bus_type

HID underlying bus types.

=over

=item SDL_HID_API_BUS_UNKNOWN = 0 - Unknown bus type

=item SDL_HID_API_BUS_USB = 1 - USB bus Specifications: https://usb.org/hid

=item SDL_HID_API_BUS_BLUETOOTH = 2 - Bluetooth or Bluetooth LE bus Specifications: https://www.bluetooth.com/specifications/specs/human-interface-device-profile-1-1-1/ https://www.bluetooth.com/specifications/specs/hid-service-1-0/ https://www.bluetooth.com/specifications/specs/hid-over-gatt-profile-1-0/

=item SDL_HID_API_BUS_I2C = 3 - I2C bus Specifications: https://docs.microsoft.com/previous-versions/windows/hardware/design/dn642101(v=vs.85)

=item SDL_HID_API_BUS_SPI = 4 - SPI bus Specifications: https://www.microsoft.com/download/details.aspx?id=103325

=back



